        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also beginning to expand our customer funnel to reach current small business owners who are not yet a part of the LegalZoom ecosystem.",
        "start_character": 4607,
        "end_character": 4748
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001286139-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001286139-26-000012-c577474592532624",
        "accession_number": "0001286139-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also introducing new, higher value, premium DIFM subscription offerings, enhancing the value of our existing subscription products and increasing the price of certain of our LegalZoom branded offerings to better reflect the value we believe we provide.",
        "start_character": 14766,
        "end_character": 15025
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001286139-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001286139-26-000012-c577474592532624",
        "accession_number": "0001286139-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are focused on embedding AI into our human‑led products and internal workflows—such as AI‑assisted tools for our concierge managers, sales and customer care functions—which we believe can improve productivity, reduce manual fulfillment time and enable us to support more customers.",
        "start_character": 17960,
        "end_character": 18244
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001286139-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001286139-26-000012-c577474592532624",
        "accession_number": "0001286139-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are focused on penetrating and growing the online market for legal, compliance and business management solutions.",
        "start_character": 13665,
        "end_character": 13781
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001286139-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001286139-26-000012-c577474592532624",
        "accession_number": "0001286139-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are investing in and integrating AI tools across our platform, including AI‑enabled workflow, decisioning and content solutions that help our customers more easily navigate complex legal and compliance workflows, surface relevant educational content and recommended next steps, and improve the speed, accuracy and consistency of the services we provide, while also enhancing internal productivity for our customer care, sales, fulfillment and expert support teams.",
        "start_character": 17492,
        "end_character": 17959
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001286139-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001286139-26-000012-c577474592532624",
        "accession_number": "0001286139-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are leveraging Formation Nation’s “Inc Authority” brand as a lower priced alternative to service customers seeking DIY solutions, reserving the LegalZoom brand for more premium offerings.",
        "start_character": 14575,
        "end_character": 14765
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001286139-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001286139-26-000012-c577474592532624",
        "accession_number": "0001286139-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to a wide variety of state and federal laws, rules and regulations in the U.S., including those related to internet activities, UPL, the corporate practice of law, or CPL, privacy, data protection, cybersecurity, data retention, consumer protection, content regulation, subscription offerings, virtual mail, the processing of legal documents, commercial registered agents, the provision of online payment services and other matters, which are continuously evolving and developing.",
        "start_character": 34611,
        "end_character": 35106
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001286139-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001286139-26-000012-c577474592532624",
        "accession_number": "0001286139-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are testing and implementing ways to better reorient our products towards subscription offerings.",
        "start_character": 14323,
        "end_character": 14423
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001286139-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001286139-26-000012-c577474592532624",
        "accession_number": "0001286139-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our DIFM concierge offerings expand our addressable market beyond traditional DIY online legal services into segments historically served by attorneys and other professional service providers, and supports our strategy to deliver higher‑value, expertise‑driven solutions and increase the mix of recurring revenue in our business over time.",
        "start_character": 15026,
        "end_character": 15376
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001286139-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001286139-26-000012-c577474592532624",
        "accession_number": "0001286139-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe the primary competitive factors on which we compete include ease of use, breadth of offerings, brand name recognition, reputation, price, quality and customer service.",
